      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Analyze the sentiment of the following tweet about Bitcoin (BTC) or Ethereum (ETH). Respond ONLY with ONE word: Positive, Negative, or Neutral.\n\nTweet:\n{{ $json.text }}\n\nClassification rules:\n- Positive: Bullish outlook, optimism, expected price increases, or positive market developments.\n- Negative: Bearish outlook, pessimism, expected price decreases, or negative market developments.\n- Neutral: Factual information, mixed opinions, unclear sentiment, or no clear bullish/bearish direction.\n\nClassify the sentiment expressed in the tweet, not just the presence of positive or negative words. Ignore unrelated promotional content.\n\nOutput exactly one word: Positive, Negative, or Neutral.",
